<%page args="root" />
<%doc>
Qubix OS visual product-name override for Lorax/Anaconda (DD-064).

The installer action must keep receiving the technical OCI image name so its offline
payload path and installed update target remain valid. Lorax writes that same value into
/.buildstamp as Product=, which Anaconda renders prominently. Replace only that visual
field after Lorax creates the build stamp, then fail the ISO build unless it is exact.
</%doc>
replace "^Product=.*$" "Product=Qubix OS" /.buildstamp
runcmd /usr/bin/grep -qxF "Product=Qubix OS" ${root}/.buildstamp
